pose we each take at most 18 tons, and never more than one-fifth of the stock above the 5-ton reserve, rounded down to whole tons. So if next month starts with 20 tons, our cap would be 3 each; at 10 tons, it would be 1 each. We should confirm the actual stock and our agreement before every round.\n\nThat preserves the recovery opportunity if everyone complies, though it neither guarantees replenishment nor proves this is the best long-run strategy. Once catches are revealed, let’s review any departures openly rather than retaliate by overfishing.\n\nJohn, would you agree to 18 this month with that stock-dependent rule, or do you prefer a lower cap?\nConversation conclusion by me: no\nNext speaker: John","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0a94de68f44bda1f016af14465b33087d0bf45aa652f347293","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_options":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"low","generate_summary":null,"mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1093,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":1090,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":339,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":129},"total_tokens":1432},"user":null},"sha256":"1f745ceb185970dc1b563c46cb96e8b1c7adf08ecbe79c7e404ca3fca5cdc201"}